question reformulates the question and sends it back to the agent to search again (at most once), following the official LangGraph agentic RAG tutorial;
- answer: an LLM (NVIDIA Nemotron, free tier via OpenRouter) answers only from the retrieved sources and cites them like [1];
- check: a second LLM call verifies the answer is supported by the sources; if not, the answer is regenerated once with s

